  "description": "Beargrease C GX AXS just might be the best fat-tire bike we’ve ever put out in the world. It rides on massive 27.5 x 4.5\" tires for excellent rollover, traction, and float on soft surfaces. Beargrease feels like a modern trail MTB, with a long wheelbase, well-balanced weight distribution, and a dropper post for more control. The carbon fiber frame is stiff, lightweight, and loaded with cargo mounts for staying supplied on Adventure by Bike over any terrain, from winter ultras to hitting hot laps on snowy groomed singletrack. 45NRTH carbon rims elevate the ride with an extra-responsive feel, and SRAM’s GX AXS drivetrain delivers effortless shifting and a wide gear range for grinding through tough terrain or pushing race pace.",
